# Sealed history is compared byte for byte: no line-ending conversion on checkout (PROGRAM.41.1, PROGRAM.42).
docs/decision-history/** -text
docs/task-history/** -text
docs/history/** -text
# Review histories, and the archive they leave for, are compared byte for byte too (PROGRAM.55.1).
docs/reviews/** -text
docs/review-history/** -text
# The sealed evaluation set: no diff, log patch or grep of a commit that holds it prints a line of it (PROGRAM.76).
docs/evaluation/frozen/** -diff
docs/evaluation/frozen/MANIFEST.txt diff
